{
  "id": 8835553067207,
  "title": "Custom Trucking Semi Truck on Textured Metallic Background Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-trucking-semi-truck-on-textured-metallic-background-comforter-5ee1903c53-5ee1903c53",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with the Custom Trucker Bedding Set from Jeminise, designed specifically for truckers and trucking enthusiasts who love the road. This cozy, modern comforter set features a striking semi-truck graphic on a textured metallic background, bringing a stylish, contemporary look to your personal space. Fully customizable with a personal name input, this bedding set is crafted from soft, lightweight, and breathable polyester to ensure maximum comfort and durability for all seasons.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a custom text input option to easily personalize the bedding with your chosen name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric that is super soft, lightweight, breathable, and eco-friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant &amp; Durable Colors:</strong> Advanced digital printing techniques ensure the colors remain vibrant and resist fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly sized to fit various bed setups, with options including US Twin, Full, Queen, and King.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water, quick-drying, and simple to maintain without high heat.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes as a complete set including 1 Duvet Cover or Comforter with optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Metal Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
